  "historyNote": "#4583, eff 1-24-89; ss by #5650, eff 7-1-93; ss by #6953, eff 3-1-99, ss by #8826, eff 3-1-07, EXPIRED: 3-1-15 New. #10866, eff 7-1-15; ss by #14512, eff 2-7-26, EXPIRES: 2-7-36",
